    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Tactical Reserve</h2><p><em>You plan for the moment when the plan fails.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>At each Soma Break you bank 2 rerolls. When you or a creature you can see within 6 squares makes an attack roll, attribute check, or defense check, you may spend one to reroll the lowest die of that roll (keep the higher). Unspent rerolls are replaced at the next Soma Break.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>⚙ Each Soma Break banks 2 rerolls (a refill, not a stack). Yours auto-fire on your next roll; handing one to an ally is moved by the GM.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
